      "title": "feat: add todo statistics endpoint and progress display",
      "body": "## Requirements\n- REQ-01: Added `GET /api/todos/stats` endpoint in `server.js` that returns `{ total, completed, open }` counts for the current todo list.\n- REQ-02: Added a `<div role=\"status\" id=\"todo-stats\">` element in `index.html` that displays `<completed> of <total> done` text, updated after every add, toggle, or delete via the stats API.\n- REQ-03: Added two new tests in `app/test.js` covering the stats endpoint: one verifying the response shape and one verifying the counts update correctly after add, toggle, and delete operations.\n\n## Testing\nRan `npm test` from `app/` directory.\n\nResults:\n- 11 tests total\n- 11 passed\n- 0 failed\n- 0 skipped",
